                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f89e5e8-858b-31d5-9296-c68fcc79cf8e",
                        "entry_id": "0613d0f8-6b88-32db-8f74-b59373ed4a5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "（尤指《聖經》中的）譜系"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "nonstandard"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0f3b516-eb70-4d59-8ed5-c120ed0aa2bd",
                                "sense_id": "8f89e5e8-858b-31d5-9296-c68fcc79cf8e",
                                "text": "To put food on the table, Ruth gleaned in the fields and one of the fields belonged to Boaz who noticed her and admired her. They married and Ruth bore a son, Obed. There ensues a begat-ridden genealogy and....",
                                "translation": "为了维持生计，路得在田里拾取麦穗，其中一块田地属于波阿斯。波阿斯注意到她，并对她心生爱慕。他们结为夫妻，路得生了一个儿子，名叫俄备得。从此，路得的家谱就繁衍得十分精彩……"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75b5609e-636c-4609-b24e-bc183ee3a38b",
                                "sense_id": "8f89e5e8-858b-31d5-9296-c68fcc79cf8e",
                                "text": "There's a bunch of begats in First Chronicles, chapter six, and it's way dull, especially if you consider what a begat involves.",
                                "translation": "《历代志上》第六章里有很多关于家谱的记载，非常枯燥乏味，尤其是考虑到家谱所包含的内容。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b03ec29-1d7e-4e58-8c88-5b0f340d223d",
                                "sense_id": "8f89e5e8-858b-31d5-9296-c68fcc79cf8e",
                                "text": "In many instances even that cannot be done,\" and John Edgar Wideman prefaces Damballah with \"A Begat Chart\" and a \"Family Tree.\"",
                                "translation": "在许多情况下，甚至连这都做不到。”约翰·埃德加·威德曼在《丹巴拉》一书的序言中写道：“族谱图”和“家谱”。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "3cb49c01-7f86-39ae-9d88-5b7fee2434e0",
                "word": "begat",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "en",
